Z||000013||Ronnie||10-18-2001||11:05 PM||||Hey Tyler. I was gone all last weekend. Didn't know you had decided to let the shop go ahead with the swap, but probably the best thing to do. Glad it's in the process for you. Let me know when you get it running.||||reg||6
